e restaurant of your choice in Puerto Nuevo.\n\nBottled water will be available.\n\nDon’t forget your valid passport—you’ll need it to cross the U.S.–Mexico border.\n\nPlease wear comfortable shoes and bring sunscreen, a hat, and cash or card for personal purchases and meals.\n\nGratuities for your guide and driver are not included but appreciated.\n\nWe look forward to providing you with an unforgettable Baja experience!", "cancellation_notes": "There are no refunds. All tours are subject to cancellation if we do not meet the minimum number of participants. In the event of cancellation on our end, you will receive an email notification and a full refund will be issued via the original method of payment.\n\nPlease note:\n\nA valid passport is required to cross the U.S.–Mexico border. Failure to present valid travel documentation will result in denied entry, and no refunds will be issued.\n\nThank you for your understanding.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/items/644674/images/1499295/", "pk": 1499295, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4eUJKZ9HSeWaIBcN69ew", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4eUJKZ9HSeWaIBcN69ew", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/items/644674/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4eUJKZ9HSeWaIBcN69ew", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4eUJKZ9HSeWaIBcN69ew", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/items/644674/images/1499296/", "pk": 1499296, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/uB9BtezSQyY2G8fhRbwU", "i